        <sequence id="seq_Saimiri_sciureus" spec="Sequence" taxon="Saimiri_sciureus" totalcount="4" value="-TAACTTCTTAATTACCGAGAAAGTG-CGCAAGAACTGCTAATTCATGCTCCCAAGACTAACAACTTGGCTTCCTCAACTTTTAAAGGATAGTAGTTATCCATTGGTCTTAGGAGCCAAAAACATTGGTGCAACTCCAAATAAAAGTAATA---ATACACTTCTCCATCACTCTAATAACACTAATTAGCCTACTAGCGCCAATCCTAGCTACCCTCATTAACCCTAACAAAAGCACACTATACCCGTACTACGTAAAACTAGCCATCATCTACGCCCTCATTACCAGTACCTTATCTATAATATTCTTTATCCTTACAGGCCAAGAATCAATAATTTCAAACTGACACTGAATAACTATCCAAACCATCAAACTATCCCTAAGCTT"/>
                            
